; ZX Spectrum +2A/+3 v4.0 ROM 2 (+3DOS) labels for the Xpeccy+ debugger.
;
; The jump table at #0100: the names the +3 manual gives the +3DOS and disk
; driver calls, part of Xpeccy+ (MIT). The rest: Klive's v4.0 names, then its v4.1
; names carried over where the bytes are the same (blocks of 8 bytes or more).
;
; Names and data ranges from Klive IDE's ROM annotations, files spp3-40-2.rom.dis, spp3-41-2.rom.dis
; (https://github.com/Dotneteer/kliveide, src/public/roms, commit e227b87c,
; 2026-11-06), MIT license:
